# ADR-001: Generated autonoetic product baseline

## Context

This product is a downstream overlay on Maistro's Turing package. Autonoetic
choices must remain explicit without copying engine internals.

## Decision

Adopt an awareness loop of `{{ awareness_loop_hz }} Hz`, the `{{ self_model }}`
self model, memory consolidation `{{ memory_consolidator }}`, and the
`{{ dossier_store }}` dossier adapter. Identity and external path values are
supplied only through the runtime environment.

## Acceptance criteria

- Rendered values are importable as a typed, immutable configuration.
- Awareness period remains the reciprocal of the positive configured rate.
- Missing identity or selected storage variables fail readiness without
  retaining their values.
- Engine dependencies remain pinned to the reviewed substrate ref.

## Out of scope

Model-provider setup and an unbounded autonomous loop are deliberately not
started by this scaffold.
